{"v":1,"book":"Ps","ch":70,"verses":[{"n":0,"text":"For the Chief Musician. By David. A reminder."},{"n":1,"text":"Hurry, God, to deliver me. Come quickly to help me, LORD.","tok":[{"t":"Hurry, God, "},{"t":"to","s":["H1732"]},{"t":" deliver "},{"t":"me","s":["H2142"]},{"t":". "},{"t":"Come","s":["H2142"]},{"t":" quickly "},{"t":"to","s":["H1732"]},{"t":" help "},{"t":"me","s":["H2142"]},{"t":", "},{"t":"LORD","s":["H3068"],"a":[2]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":2,"text":"Let them be disappointed and confounded who seek my soul. Let those who desire my ruin be turned back in disgrace.","tok":[{"t":"Let "},{"t":"them","s":["H3068"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"be","s":["H3068"]},{"t":" disappointed "},{"t":"and","s":["H3068"]},{"t":" confounded "},{"t":"who","s":["H3068"]},{"t":" seek "},{"t":"my","s":["H3068"]},{"t":" soul. Let those "},{"t":"who","s":["H3068"]},{"t":" desire "},{"t":"my","s":["H3068"]},{"t":" ruin "},{"t":"be","s":["H3068"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"turned","s":["H3068"]},{"t":" back "},{"t":"in","s":["H3068"]},{"t":" disgrace."}]},{"n":3,"text":"Let them be turned because of their shame who say, “Aha! Aha!”","tok":[{"t":"Let","s":["H5315"]},{"t":" them "},{"t":"be","s":["H5315"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"turned","s":["H5472"]},{"t":" because "},{"t":"of","s":["H5315"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"their","s":["H1245"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"shame","s":["H3637"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"who","s":["H5315"]},{"t":" say, “Aha! Aha!”"}]},{"n":4,"text":"Let all those who seek you rejoice and be glad in you. Let those who love your salvation continually say, “Let God be exalted!”","tok":[{"t":"Let","s":["H7725"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"all","s":["H5921"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"those","s":["H5921"]},{"t":" who seek "},{"t":"you","s":["H5921"]},{"t":" rejoice "},{"t":"and","s":["H7725"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"be","s":["H7725"]},{"t":" glad "},{"t":"in","s":["H5921"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"you","s":["H5921"]},{"t":". "},{"t":"Let","s":["H7725"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"those","s":["H5921"]},{"t":" who love "},{"t":"your","s":["H5921"]},{"t":" salvation conti